{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pulls/357", "id": 701065696, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NzAxMDY1Njk2", "html_url": "https://github.com/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pull/357", "diff_url": "https://github.com/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pull/357.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pull/357.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/issues/357", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pulls/357/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pulls/357/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/issues/357/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pholser/junit-quickcheck/statuses/7301845145f8870ee03133a3b23265c9c5305b38", "number": 357, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Clean shared state pollution to avoid flaky tests in module core", "user": {"login": "LALAYANG", "id": 56383562, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzgzNTYy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56383562?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG", "html_url": "https://github.com/LALAYANG", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "This PR is similar to #286 and #294.\r\n\r\n1. Failed Tests:\r\n- This PR fixes 26 flaky tests in module `core`, in 4 classes:\r\n```\r\ncom.pholser.junit.quickcheck.ExhaustingAGivenSetButIncludingAnotherTest\r\ncom.pholser.junit.quickcheck.PropertyParameterConfigurationIsolationTest\r\ncom.pholser.junit.quickcheck.PropertyTupleSampleSizeTest\r\ncom.pholser.junit.quickcheck.SamplingButAlsoIncludingAGivenSetTest\r\n```\r\n2. Why they fail\r\n\r\n- These tests pollute the state shared among tests without clearing `xxx.iterations`. For example, ```com.pholser.junit.quickcheck.ExhaustingAGivenSetButIncludingAnotherTest.manyParameters``` does not clear `ManyParameters.iterations`.\r\n- It may be better to clean state pollutions so that some other tests won't fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by these tests.\r\n\r\n3. Reproduce test failures\r\n\r\n- Take ```com.pholser.junit.quickcheck.ExhaustingAGivenSetButIncludingAnotherTest.manyParameters``` for example:\r\n\r\n  Step1. Add a copy:\r\n`@Test public void copymanyParameters() { manyParameters(); }`\r\n  Step2. Run:\r\n`mvn -pl core test -Dtest=com.pholser.junit.quickcheck.ExhaustingAGivenSetButIncludingAnotherTest`\r\n\r\n- we can get failure: `java.lang.AssertionError: expected:<16> but was:<32>`\r\n\r\n4. Fix them\r\n- Reset the appropriate `xxx.iterations` to 0 at the end of each test.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2021-08-02T02:30:41Z", "updated_at": "2021-08-04T02:51:01Z", "closed_at": "2021-08-04T02:51:01Z", "merged_at": "2021-08-04T02:51:01Z", "merge_commit_sha": "bd500ce03f40fc1a306b7300b9cab3fc5f0c0485", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "LALAYANG:flaky-tests", "ref": "flaky-tests", "repo": null, "sha": "7301845145f8870ee03133a3b23265c9c5305b38", "user": {"login": "LALAYANG", "id": 56383562, "node_id": "MDQ6